2,610,240.22,619],[231.22,649.81,240.22,658.81],[384.77,369.09,393.77,378.09],[384.77,383.47,393.77,392.47],[384.77,396.2,393.77,405.2],[384.77,409.24,393.77,418.24],[384.77,422.18,393.77,431.18],[384.77,434.54,393.77,443.54],[384.77,448.21,393.77,457.21],[384.77,497.57,393.77,506.57],[384.77,529.52,393.77,538.52],[384.77,543.01,393.77,552.01],[384.77,576.47,393.77,585.47],[384.77,591.2,393.77,600.2]]},{"n":2,"form":"CM-010","keys":["cm010"],"rev":"july12026","w":612,"h":792,"items":[["Rev. July 1, 2026",36,730.34,46.36,6,0,0],["Civil Case Cover Sheet",240.64,729.07,130.72,12,1,0],["CM-010",540.43,33.9,35.56,10,1,0],["2.",36,49.13,7.51,9,0,0],["Yes",374.48,49.14,15.51,9,0,0],["No",428.31,49.13,11.5,9,0,0],["Is this case complex under rule 3.400 of the California Rules of Court?",50.71,49.13,279.62,9,0,0],["If the case is complex, mark the factors requiring exceptional judicial management:",50.71,63.53,329.13,9,0,0],["a.",50.71,78.65,7.51,9,0,0],["Large number of separately represented parties",81.6,78.64,190.09,9,0,0],["b.",50.71,92.66,7.51,9,0,0],["Extensive motion practice raising difficult or novel issues that will be time-consuming to resolve",81.6,92.64,377.13,9,0,0],["c.",50.71,106.7,7,9,0,0],["Substantial amount of documentary evidence",81.58,106.68,180.09,9,0,0],["d.",50.71,120.93,7.51,9,0,0],["Large number of witnesses",81.53,120.67,108.05,9,0,0],["e.",50.71,135.46,7.51,9,0,0],["Coordination with related actions pending in one or more courts in other counties, states, or countries, or in a federal court",81.6,135.65,484.72,9,0,0],["f.",50.71,150.87,5,9,0,0],["Substantial postjudgment judicial supervision",81.67,150.61,179.07,9,0,0],["3.",36,166.48,7.51,9,0,0],["Remedies sought",50.7,166.49,70.03,9,0,0],["(check all that apply):",123.24,166.49,85.03,9,2,0],["a.",50.7,181.56,7.51,9,0,0],["monetary",81.56,181.54,37.51,9,0,0],["b.",50.71,196.85,7.51,9,0,0],["nonmonetary; declaratory or injunctive relief",81.58,196.84,174.56,9,0,0],["c.",50.71,212.39,7,9,0,0],["punitive",81.51,212.13,31.01,9,0,0],["4.",36,231.84,7.51,9,0,0],["Number of causes of action",50.71,231.32,109.55,9,0,0],["(specify):",162.77,231.32,36.5,9,2,0],["5.",36,252.1,7.51,9,0,0],["Is this case a class action suit?",50.72,251.29,123.55,9,0,0],["Yes",216.43,252.1,15.51,9,0,0],["No",265.31,252.1,11.5,9,0,0],["6.",36.06,271.82,7.51,9,0,0],["If there are any known related cases, file and serve a notice of related case.",50.76,271.85,301.65,9,0,0],["(You may use form CM-015.)",354.94,271.85,116.03,9,2,0],["Date:",36.06,290.42,21.51,9,0,0],["Type or print name",118.23,320.29,75.53,9,0,0],["Signature of party or attorney for party",377.62,320.29,152.07,9,0,0],["Plaintiff must file this cover sheet with the first paper filed in the action or proceeding (except small claims cases or cases filed under the Probate",50.71,364.03,510.43,8,0,0],["Code, Family Code, or Welfare and Institutions Code). (Cal. Rules of Court, rule 3.220.) Failure to file may result in sanctions.",50.71,373.63,443.27,8,0,0],["File this cover sheet in addition to any cover sheet required by local court rule.",50.71,391.31,276.12,8,0,0],["If this case is complex under rule 3.400 et seq. of the California Rules of Court, or a collections case under rule 3.740, you must serve a copy of",50.71,405.44,507.34,8,0,0],["this cover sheet on all other parties to the action or proceeding. (Cal. Rules of Court, rule 3.220.)",50.71,415.04,340.6,8,0,0],["Unless this is a collections case under rule 3.740 or a complex case, this cover sheet will be used for statistical purposes only.",50.71,432.8,445.51,8,0,0],["NOTICE",288.63,347.26,34,9,1,0],["INSTRUCTIONS ON HOW TO COMPLETE THE COVER SHEET",174.49,459.42,263.03,9,1,0],["To Plaintiffs and Others Filing First Papers.",36,475.26,185.05,9,1,0],["If you are filing a first paper (for example, a complaint) in a civil case, you",223.53,475.26,290.61,9,0,0],["must",516.66,475.26,21.5,9,1,0],["complete and file, along with your first paper, the Civil Case Cover Sheet contained on pages 1 and 2. This information will be used to",36.01,486.06,531.24,9,0,0],["compile statistics about the types and numbers of cases filed. You must complete items 1 through 6 on the sheet. In item 1, you must",36.01,496.86,529.25,9,0,0],["check",36.01,507.66,23.51,9,0,0],["one",62.02,507.66,16,9,1,0],["box for the case type that best describes the case. If the case fits both a general and a more specific type of case listed in",80.52,507.66,483.25,9,0,0],["item 1, check the more specific one. If the case has multiple causes of action, check the box that best indicates the",36.01,518.46,456.23,9,0,0],["primary",494.76,518.46,33.01,9,1,0],["cause of",530.27,518.46,34.02,9,0,0],["action. To assist you in completing the sheet, examples of the cases that belong under each case type in item 1 are provided on page 3",36.01,529.26,538.78,9,0,0],["of this form. A cover sheet must be filed only with your initial paper. Failure to file a cover sheet with the first paper filed in a civil case",36.01,540.06,528.21,9,0,0],["may subject a party, its counsel, or both to sanctions under rules 2.30 and 3.220 of the California Rules of Court.",36.01,550.86,447.22,9,0,0],["To Parties in Rule 3.740 Collections Cases.",36.01,564.14,183.57,9,1,0],["A \"collections case\" under rule 3.740 of the California Rules of Court is defined as an",222.08,564.14,337.55,9,0,0],["action for recovery of money owed in a sum stated to be certain that is not more than $35,000, exclusive of interest and attorney's fees,",36.01,574.94,537.49,9,0,0],["arising from a transaction in which property, services, or money was acquired on credit. A collections case does not include an action",36.01,585.74,528.71,9,0,0],["seeking the following: (1) tort damages, (2) punitive damages, (3) recovery of real property, (4) recovery of personal property, or (5) a",36.01,596.54,529.2,9,0,0],["prejudgment writ of attachment. The identification of a case as a rule 3.740 collections case on this form means that it will be exempt",36.01,607.34,529.24,9,0,0],["from the general time-for-service requirements and case management rules, unless a defendant files a responsive pleading. A rule",36.01,618.14,519.22,9,0,0],["3.740 collections case will be subject to the requirements for service and obtaining a judgment in rule 3.740.",36.01,628.94,429.2,9,0,0],["To Parties in Complex Cases.",36.01,641.71,126.05,9,1,0],["In complex cases only, parties must also use the Civil Case Cover Sheet to designate whether the",164.56,641.71,390.17,9,0,0],["case is complex. If a plaintiff believes the case is complex under rule 3.400 of the California Rules of Court, this must be indicated by",36.01,652.51,527.23,9,0,0],["completing the appropriate boxes in items 1 and 2. If a plaintiff designates a case as complex, the cover sheet must be served with the",36.01,663.31,534.76,9,0,0],["complaint on all parties to the action. A defendant may file and serve no later than the time of its first appearance a joinder in the",36.01,674.11,509.76,9,0,0],["plaintiff's designation, a counter-designation that the case is not complex, or, if the plaintiff has made no designation, a designation that",36.01,684.91,536.51,9,0,0],["the case is complex.",36.01,695.71,81.53,9,0,0],["SEE PAGE 3 FOR INFORMATION PURPOSES ONLY.",351.06,709.46,223.54,9,1,0],["CM-010",498.63,729.7,32,9,1,0],[", Page 2 of 3",530.63,730.71,45.37,8,0,0]],"fields":[[201.67,233.19,570.07,243.27,9,0],[61.26,292.31,169.26,302.31,9,0],[36.06,310.34,275.94,320.38,9,0]],"boxes":[[358.28,51.03,367.28,60.03],[412.11,51.03,421.11,60.03],[65.4,80.54,74.4,89.54],[65.4,94.53,74.4,103.53],[65.4,108.57,74.4,117.57],[65.4,122.56,74.4,131.56],[65.4,137.54,74.4,146.54],[65.4,152.51,74.4,161.51],[65.4,183.43,74.4,192.43],[65.4,198.73,74.4,207.73],[65.4,214.02,74.4,223.02],[200.23,254,209.23,263],[248.51,254,257.51,263]]},{"n":3,"form":"CM-010","keys":["cm010"],"rev":"july12026","w":612,"h":792,"items":[["For your protection and privacy, please press the Cl